  "reasoning": "The claim states that the Mikoyan design bureau developed the planes operated by the main unit based at the 22nd Air Base of the Polish Air Force. According to passage [2], the main unit based at the 22nd Air Base is the 41st Air Tactical Squadron flying MiG-29 fighters. Passage [5] confirms that the 41st Tactical Squadron operates Mikoyan MiG-29 jet fighters. Passage [6] confirms that the Mikoyan MiG-29 was developed by the Mikoyan design bureau. Therefore, the claim is true.",
  "summary": "The claim is TRUE. The 22nd Air Base's main unit, the 41st Tactical Squadron, operates MiG-29 fighters, which were developed by the Mikoyan design bureau."
